    "$t": "做伙來唸詩 - 問風"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; color: #333;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: #000; font-size: 36px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">問風</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0;\">/ 洪惠玟</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjQ5YOlwWUV9QasLUciuwS9xjC-3UfbddTSuk-aBW-aRO4ODqXDZ3B6CMxmC5jtOBgmxJ7oVY1rf8PBFuIlsGWuXjilPA1IQijusKXJ_0JI-NbmBhJzU7Sph--rJDFPPu4msbHuMl86A2IH4aIExD5470vAGdFwnmsjFkXxywI0qp6QskFsFwEpnS69N4ym\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhkmyjEm8hcWWOGk06FmboXLobxlySL1Spmr8d9l_vPI5UliaJfvM5SvUZcjv-muE7g70PegEzjSz-So7_3K5BehgasivsbCOXpaZdMSxQPyPzuL3eW5qVtqKmbK6zQFY-u3PQ-H9Va2M6mBMdrtKkkmyap1Cntwp0JpHnS-IP9b5acpypIi0nCnLuQNhUJ\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: justify; padding: 0 10px;\">\n        已經三月天--ah！<br>佈田花開kah真súi意<br>Tân雷一響聲<br>驚蟄（keⁿ-ti̍t）夢中ê萬物緊來醒<br>開喉唱歌koh大細聲<br><br>有雷聲　有風雨<br>我問風　啥mih時chūn天氣ē穩定？<br>伊無答案　叫我問天<br>我問天　天mā幌頭<br>講阮人無照倫理　天mā無照甲子<br>啥mih溫室效應　啥mih氣候變遷、海洋升溫<br>講阮人類真麻煩<br>製造空氣汙染、廢物汙染、海洋汙染leh作亂<br>是阮愛埋怨天　iah是天愛埋怨--阮？<br><br>有時出日　有時陰暗<br>逐禮拜冷冷寒寒三五工<br>老大人寒kah講m̄-thang<br>作穡人巡田水也tio̍h看天食飯<br>掠魚人講tio̍h-ài好天chiah出帆<br>寒風吹--來m̄是春風<br>鳥隻、魚塭仔ê魚仔mā ē寒--死bē得意<br>春風--啊春風<br>你吹向阮ê面　阮soah無滿面春風<br>行路mā無風<br>身體ài保重<br>M̄-thang感--著tòe流行<br>Chit款風寒歹適應<br><br>我koh再問風<br>啥mih時chūn天氣chiah ē khah穩定？<br>伊講ài看天意<br>老大人bat講——未食五日粽，破裘m̄敢放<br>出日、烏陰、落雨看氣象<br>溫度koân-koân低低chhu流籠<br>寒寒熱熱無定著<br>有時一下寒　有時一下熱<br>Beh寒beh熱隨在--伊<br>春風巧巧仔想　kā阮放風聲<br>講就是「春天後母面」chit个名<br><br>人若疼惜大自然　就bē受天譴<br>天氣也ē改善<br>春天就ē好回應　氣候分明<br>我就m̄免koh再問風<br>\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjRyBwV2qmwN7lihYQhlBL6eAgLJJdsrrBpSPc4kQp89xrU4BHgspIC7QmrFX7evJavlOhLCjtPx4iKPH5nmu1zXESrMcUPD1Nk5Td9hL_ERq8i1GDid8ESy04C-wlfvSBJ8QVNCqwL6L9gbGheUXLO80iH15tahzf2iO2KPZac7MfdSTBotktfdC4gjC22\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 384期，2026年03月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br>\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br>\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
